    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wildcat Snack Attack is a new survival game where you have to protect your snacks against Wildcats!\u00a0 Waves of cats will pursue you, so get ready to run, dodge, and throw. Do you have what it takes to keep your snacks safe? Or will you have to spend all your precious bean bucks? Play now, fill up your water balloons, and survive!</p>",
